  "description": "The Smok Novo Classy Pod Vape Kit delivers compact versatility and modern design in one sleek device. Powered by a 1350mAh built-in battery, it reaches up to 35W of output and pairs intuitive operation with reliable performance. The 0.96-inch TFT screen displays wattage, battery life and puff count clearly, while a combination of button-fire and auto-draw activation keeps each vape effortless. Two fixed-coil pods come included to suit different vaping preferences. The 0.8ohm CLX pod features a side-fill design for MTL (mouth-to-lung) vaping with 50/50 or Nic Salt e-liquids, while the 0.6ohm CLX pod uses a side-fill port for a looser, restricted direct-to-lung (RDL) draw with high-VG e-liquid. Both pods feature integrated mesh coils for smooth, consistent flavour and a clean refill experience. An adjustable airflow slider lets you fine-tune the inhale between tighter or more open draws, while USB-C charging quickly restores power for all-day use. With built-in protections and Smok’s signature build quality, the Novo Classy balances performance, portability and ease of use for everyday vaping. Choose a vape juice that aligns perfectly with the power and style of this kit. We recommend using 50/50 or Nic Salt E-Liquid with this kit Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
